      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Issues:\n\nModelDescr is a semi validated object, we \ndon't know if it is tested or not.\n\nIt is semi validated, because we checked if files\nexist or axes of test tensors matches the ones\nfrom the tensor descriptors \n\nI just want to run the model, why do I need the\ntest tensors?",
